{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51239","headline":"幸蜀回居南内梦中见妃子於蓬山太真院作诗遗之使焚於马嵬山下 · 李隆基","name":"幸蜀回居南内梦中见妃子於蓬山太真院作诗遗之使焚於马嵬山下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风急云惊雨不成，觉来仙梦甚分明。\n当时苦根银屏影，遮隔仙姬秪听声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李隆基","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}